<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs start flat to softer, eye U.S. data.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs start flat to softer, eye U.S. data.</headline>
<text>
<p>0750 GMT - OLOs flat to softer ahead of U.S. GDP, Chicago in session (1400 GMT) but NBB not seen following  NBBY.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.59% (unch) BE286=, 9 bps over Bunds (10)  MEUR</p>
<p>*OLO fut -0.11 at 122.07 BGBc1 ;Mark/Bfr 20.6470/85(20.6474/84)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.60/63% (60 65), 1-wk repo 3.92/98 (90/99)  TTFBXL</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
